From: BananaOS Duo Lite maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] interconnect: qcom: add SM6125 fabric paths for Venus bandwidth

Adapt the SM6125 NoC driver and nodes from PeacockProject/linux_sm6125_ginkgo
commit db3f159aa32c11688ee4873a6218ea113052fee6 (Yunus Emre YOLDAS).
Retain its GPL-2.0-only copyright header. Adapt DT registers to this kernel's
64-bit address/size cells. Required by the Venus video-mem/cpu-cfg paths;
existing display, GPU and storage consumers remain unchanged.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/interconnect/qcom/sm6125.c
@@ -0,0 +1,1417 @@
